<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Sea Union - 40,000-45,000 tonnes coke Xingang/Piombino 5/15 July $15.90 fio 4,000 shinc/7,000 shinc Duferco.</p>
<p>ORE - Loire Ore - 140,000/10 tonnes ore Seven Islands/Rotterdam 1/15 Aug $4.65 fio 7 days shinc Rohstoffhandel.</p>
</text>
